      "translation": "根据名称获取给定缓存的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Enable <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>s to synchronize cache put/evict operations with ongoing Spring-managed transactions.",
      "translation": "使<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>能够将缓存的写入/删除操作与正在进行的 Spring 管理的事务同步。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure whether to allow cache creation at runtime.",
      "translation": "配置是否允许在运行时创建缓存。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Enables cache statistics.",
      "translation": "启用缓存统计信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html#getMissingCache(java.lang.String)\"><code>RedisCacheManager.getMissingCache(String)</code></a> returns null for any non-configured, undeclared\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> instead of a new <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> instance. This allows the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/CompositeCacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>CompositeCacheManager</code></a> to participate.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html#getMissingCache(java.lang.String)\"><code>RedisCacheManager.getMissingCache(String)</code></a> 对于任何未配置且未声明的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> 返回 null，而不是创建一个新的 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 实例。这使得 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/CompositeCacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>CompositeCacheManager</code></a> 能够参与其中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
