      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Append a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> of cache names to be pre initialized with current <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>.\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> This calls depends on <a href=\"#cacheDefaults(org.springframework.data.redis.cache.RedisCacheConfiguration)\"><code>cacheDefaults(RedisCacheConfiguration)</code></a> using whatever\ndefault <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> is present at the time of invoking this method.",
      "translation": "向缓存名称集合中添加一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a>，该集合将在当前<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>被预初始化。\n<strong>注意：</strong>此调用依赖于<a href=\"#cacheDefaults(org.springframework.data.redis.cache.RedisCacheConfiguration)\"><code>cacheDefaults(RedisCacheConfiguration)</code></a>，并使用在调用此方法时存在的任何默认<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Append a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> of cache names to be pre initialized with current <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将当前<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的类\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>预初始化的缓存名称集合追加到<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Set</code></a>中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Builder for creating a <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于创建<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的类\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>的构建器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> used by the <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> to acquire\n         connections to Redis when performing <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> operations; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - 由 <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> 使用的连接工厂，供 <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> 在执行 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 操作时获取与 Redis 的连接；该值不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheWriter</code> - <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> used to perform <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> operations by executing\n         appropriate Redis commands; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheWriter</code> - 用于通过执行适当的 Redis 命令来执行 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 操作的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果给定的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> 为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the given <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> is null.",
